            <hr /><br clear="all" /><div id="title"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-size:0.9em;"><style>span.DottedLeaders::after {content:"..................";}</style><font color="#B30000"><s> An act relating to the Budget Act of 2025. </s></font><font color="blue" class="blue_text"><i>An act making appropriations for the support of the government of the State of California and for several public purposes
                  in accordance with the provisions of Section 12 of Article IV of the Constitution of the State of California, relating to
