               <h2>LEGISLATIVE COUNSEL'S DIGEST</h2>
            </div><br /><div style="margin:0 0 1em 0"><span id="subject">AB101, as amended, Gabriel
                  .
                  													Budget Act of 2025.</span></div>
            <div><span id="digesttext"><font color="blue" class="blue_text"><i>
                  <div style="margin:0 0 1em 0;">This bill would make appropriations for the support of state government for the 2025–26 fiscal year.</div>
                  <div style="margin:0 0 1em 0;">This bill would declare that it is to take effect immediately as a Budget Bill.</div></i></font><style>span.DottedLeaders::after {content:"..................";}</style><font color="#B30000"><s><p style="display:inline;"><s>This bill would express the intent of the Legislature to enact statutory changes relating to
                  the Budget Act of 2025.</s></p><div style="margin:0 0 1em 0;"></div></s></font></span></div><span class="hidden">
               <h2>Digest Key</h2></span><span id="vote">
               Vote:
