                              shall be reduced by the
                              			 amount transferred in Item 0250-011-0001 to provide adequate resources to the Judicial Branch Workers’ Compensation Fund
                              to pay workers’ compensation claims for judicial branch employees and justices, and administrative costs pursuant to Section
                              68114.10 of the Government Code.
                           </div>
                        </td>
                        <td valign="bottom" width="80"></td>
                     </tr>
                     <tr>
                        <td valign="top" width="24"></td>
