                        <td valign="top" width="24">17.</td>
                        <td colspan="5" valign="top" width="288">
                           <div style="">The funds appropriated in Schedule (4) shall be for payments to contractual court interpreters and certified and registered
                              court interpreters employed by the courts for services provided during court proceedings and other services related to pending
                              court proceedings, including services provided outside a<style>span.DottedLeaders::after {content:"..................";}</style><font color="#B30000"><s> courtroom. Those funds are also available for the following court interpreter coordinator positions: 1.0 each in counties
