                              of the 32nd through the 58th classes.</s></font><font color="blue" class="blue_text"><i>
                              			 courtroom, and for court interpreter coordinator positions.</i></font> For the purposes of this provision, “court interpreter coordinators” may be full- or part-time court<style>span.DottedLeaders::after {content:"..................";}</style><font color="#B30000"><s> employees, and shall be concurrently certified and registered court interpreters in good standing under existing law.</s></font><font color="blue" class="blue_text"><i> employees.</i></font>
