                        <td valign="top" width="24">1.</td>
                        <td colspan="5" valign="top" width="288">
                           <div style="">The amount appropriated in this item may include revenues derived from the assessment of fines and penalties imposed as specified
                              in Section 13332.18 of the Government Code.
                           </div>
                        </td>
