                        <td colspan="5" valign="top" width="288">
                           <div style="">The State Department of Forestry and Fire Protection, the Department of General Services, and the State Public Works Board
                              are authorized to execute and deliver any and all leases, contracts, agreements, or other documents necessary or advisable
                              to consummate the sale and issuance of bonds in accordance with the State Building Construction Act of 1995 (Part 10b
                              			 (commencing with Section 15800) of Division 3 of Title 2 of the Government Code) or otherwise to effectuate the financing
                              of the scheduled project.
                           </div>
                        </td>
