                        <td valign="top" width="24">2.</td>
                        <td colspan="5" valign="top" width="288">
                           <div style="">The amount appropriated in Program 3575 shall be used to reimburse the Department of Justice for legal services. In addition
                              to the amount in Program 3575, upon order of the Department of Finance, any non-General Fund Budget Act item for support of
                              the State Water Resources Control Board may be
