                        <td colspan="5" valign="top" width="288">
                           <div style="">The funding level appropriated in this item for purposes related to local child support agency administration is intended
                              to align budgeted resources, on a temporary basis, with recent trends in annual expenditures. This program in recent years
                              has had savings that generally materialize at the end of the fiscal year due to challenges in the labor market, staff attrition,
                              			 and the timeline necessary for local agencies to process recruitments. Rather than wait until the savings revert to the
                              General Fund, and due to the State’s current fiscal situation, the state budget captures these dollars up front. The State
                              does not intend for the identification of these savings at the outset of the fiscal year, rather than at the end, to have
                              an adverse impact on service delivery at the local level or result in staffing reductions or layoffs.
