                        <td colspan="4" valign="top" width="264">
                           <div style="">Notwithstanding any other law, each
                              			 local planning council receiving funds appropriated in Schedule (3) shall meet the requirements of Section 10486 of the
                              Welfare and Institutions Code to the extent feasible and to the extent data is readily accessible.
                           </div>
                        </td>
