                        <td valign="top" width="24"></td>
                        <td valign="top" width="24">(b)</td>
                        <td colspan="4" valign="top" width="264">
                           <div style="">The Department of Finance may authorize the transfer of funds appropriated for the CWS-CARES project in Schedule (1) to Item
                              5180-001-0001, for project-related activities, including, but not limited to, necessary personal services expenditures, interagency
