                        <td colspan="4" valign="top" width="264"><font color="blue" class="blue_text"><i>By
                           			 August 15, 2025, the Department of Social Services, in coordination with the Department of Finance, shall report to the
                           Joint Legislative Budget Committee, relevant fiscal and policy committee staff, and the Legislative Analyst’s Office any changes
                           in CWS-CARESS project funding resulting from the federal Administration for Children and Families’ determination of the project’s
                           Comprehensive Child Welfare Information System claiming status.</i></font>
