                     <tr>
                        <td valign="top" width="24"></td>
                        <td valign="top" width="24">1.</td>
                        <td colspan="5" valign="top" width="288">
                           <div style="">The amount appropriated in this item shall be available for the Anti-Recidivism Coalition to support operation of the Hope
                              and Redemption Team Program to provide rehabilitative programming and reentry support to incarcerated people during and after
