                        <td valign="top" width="24">(b)</td>
                        <td colspan="4" valign="top" width="264">
                           <div style="">$18,500,000 shall be available to support the warm handoff and reentry of offenders transitioning from state prison to communities.
                              Priority shall be given to individuals released to state parole.
                           </div>
                        </td>
                        <td valign="bottom" width="80"></td>
