                        <td valign="top" width="24"></td>
                        <td valign="top" width="24">2.</td>
                        <td colspan="5" valign="top" width="288">
                           <div style="">The State Department of Education shall provide to the Legislature, the Legislative Analyst’s Office, and the Department of
