                        <td valign="top" width="24">6.</td>
                        <td colspan="5" valign="top" width="288">
                           <div style="">The reimbursement a school receives for free and reduced-price meals served to pupils in elementary, middle, or high schools
                              included within a school district, charter school, or county office of education shall be<style>span.DottedLeaders::after {content:"..................";}</style><font color="#B30000"><s> $1.0028</s></font><font color="blue" class="blue_text"><i> $1.0015</i></font> per<br /> meal.
