                        <td colspan="3" valign="top" width="240">
                           <div style="">At least $943,000 shall be used to support the High Tech Centers for activities, including, but not limited to, training of
                              district employees, staff, and students in the use of specialized computer equipment for the disabled.
                           </div>
                        </td>
