                        <td valign="top" width="24"></td>
                        <td valign="top" width="24">10.</td>
                        <td colspan="5" valign="top" width="288">
                           <div style="">The funds appropriated in Schedule (9) shall be allocated to a community college district to contract with the State Department
                              of
