                        <td valign="top" width="24"></td>
                        <td valign="top" width="24">11.</td>
                        <td colspan="5" valign="top" width="288">
                           <div style="">Of the amount appropriated in Schedule (10), $685,000 is available to support the Academic Senate for California Community
                              Colleges course identification numbering system efforts and shall be subject to the requirements of subparagraph (B) of paragraph
                              (5) of subdivision (b) of Section 70901 of the Education Code.
