                        <td valign="top" width="24"></td>
                        <td valign="top" width="24"><font color="blue" class="blue_text"><i>4.</i></font></td>
                        <td colspan="5" valign="top" width="288"><font color="blue" class="blue_text"><i>Of the funds appropriated in Schedule (1), up to $650,000 is provided to support an audit of work performed by the California
                           Association of Professional Scientists, Bargaining Unit 10. The Department of Finance may adjust this appropriation to ensure
