                        <td valign="top" width="24"></td>
                        <td valign="top" width="24">3.</td>
                        <td colspan="5" valign="top" width="288">As a condition of receiving funds pursuant to Provision 1, indigent defense providers shall provide data and outcomes, including,
                           but not limited to, expenditure of funds and a description of how the funding was used and what outcomes were achieved, to
                           the State Public Defender in a manner determined by the State Public Defender.
                        </td>
                        <td align="right" valign="bottom" width="80"></td>
